window.products.push({"id":466172,"name":"Glad for Kids GladWare Variety Pack 26ct Back to School Pattern Food Storage Containers with Lids | Mixed Sizes Kids Food Containers with Rainbows & C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PdixRs3LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dress up your dishware with Glad for Kids! We aim to make even the pickiest eaters smile, whether you’re having a themed occasion or simply trying to inspire a bit of fun at the dinner table. We believe in bringing a little magic to the mundane by bringing your family’s favorite characters and colors to the table. These Glad for Kids GladWare food storage containers feature a Back-to-School pattern, full of bright colors and patterns with rainbows, trees, squiggles, and fun shapes to make everything from snack time, school lunches, or any meal in between fun for all. This variety pack includes: two family-size square containers, 104oz (13 cups) with yellow lids; two sandwich-size square containers, 25oz (3 1/8 cups) with green lids; three snack-size rectangle containers, 9oz (1 1/8 cups) with blue lids, four mini round containers, 4oz (1/2 cup) with red lids; and 4 tiny 1.5oz dressing cups that snap into any lid. GladWare containers with fun Back-to-School designs are the kid-friendly way to prepare and store your kids’ favorite foods or send them to school with cute school lunch containers. These microwave-safe, dishwasher-safe, freezer-safe, BPA-free* food containers for kids with lids help minimize mess and simplify food storage. Microwavable food containers like these are great for reheating last night’s dinner and making it into today’s lunch! Simply lift one corner of the lid before microwaving. When you are done eating, simply rinse and put containers and lids on the top rack of the dishwasher. You can even transport both feasts and snacks with GladWare airtight food storage containers. They are extra sturdy and seal tightly to shield food from air and lock in freshness. Lids easily snap on to create a tight seal and prevent messy spills. These containers are perfect for meal prep or for your kids’ lunch containers for school. Use GladWare, and you can trust that your food is receiving quality protection. * Product not formulated with BPA (Bisphenol A).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PdixRs3LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glad","source_asin":"B0BQJJ7T1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQJJ7T1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQJJ7T1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
