window.products.push({"id":466432,"name":"Degradable Air Fryer Liners Disposable,6.3inch 100pcs Oil Proof Parchment Sheets Round, suitable for 2-4.9 QT Airfryer Accessories Paper Basket Bowl L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JKunG6FML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Non-greasy, non-stick on both sides】, easy to clean If you hate cleaning after baking, these are a necessary part of your kitchen 【The 6.3-inch parchment paper is suitable for 2-4.9 quarts of air fryers, and the 7.9-inch parchment paper is suitable for 5-11 quarts of air fryers, which perfectly fits most brands of air fryers on the market, such as Philips, ninja, cosori, etc.】 Food baked on parchment paper made from raw wood and coated with silicone oil will taste better and will not stick to the pan. 【Non-flammable and heat resistant up to 431℉】.Suitable for air fryers, microwave ovens, toaster ovens, and pans. Home baking, camping, summer parties, serving food, etc. Please avoid using without food. The parchment paper made of raw wood and silicone oil coating is biodegradable and you can use it with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JKunG6FML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SESEHUS","source_asin":"B0BFM1HSW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFM1HSW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFM1HSW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":466433,"name":"ChezMax Hanging Jewelry Organizer, Double Side Earrings and Necklecks Holder, Holds Up to 300 Pairs Earrings 20 Necklaces Rack with Roating Hanger, Ea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BXyx4xFBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Storage Capacity For Jewelry】Dimensions: 22.5*13.6 inch. The dual-side hanging earrings organizer has enough space to store your earrings/neckleces/bracelets etc. One side of the earrings holder has 600 earring holes (4 holes per one felt piece) can holds up to 300 pair of stud/pierced earrings, another side can holder 20 pcs necklaces/bracelets. The hanging jewelry organizer for all kinds of earrings, it is perfect for your jewelry collection. 【Double Side Design】The upgraded hanging earring organizer adds the function of storing necklaces, both sides can store jewelry. Double side design jewelry organizer can hang more jewelry than normal jewelry earring holder. The wall jewelry organizer comes with 20 magic tapes can hold 20 necklaces, plus magic straps to keep necklaces separated and untangled. The unique design makes store jewelries easier and save your space. 【360 Rotating Hanger】The dual-sided hanging earrings organizer with 360 degree rotating hanger, make it can be rotated to any direction you need. It can flip easily while browsing, and can be hung in a bedroom, bathroom, closet, or behind a door. It takes up less space than a piece of clothing in your closet. 【Premium Felt Material】This hanging earring holder made of double felt and handmade tailoring, it's sturdy, durable, and not easy to deform. Earrings&necklaces organizer has excellent wear resistance, well made and not easily deformed. (Note: The felt jewelry hanger organizer may be slightly bent due to shipping, it can be restored by folding it in reverse.） 【Prefect Gift Choice】This black hanging earrings holder has unique and generous appearance, and it not only can organize all kinds of earrings, such as stud, drop/dangle earrings, hoop earrings etc., but also can hang necklaces, bracelets, ankle chain. Present ideal for women, girls, girlfriends, daughters, mothers and friends in many kinds of festivals, such as Valentine's Day, Mother’s Day, Thanksgiving, Birthday, Christmas and etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BXyx4xFBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChezMax","source_asin":"B0C3HNVB37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3HNVB37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3HNVB37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
