window.products.push({"id":466441,"name":"Scott Living Terrain 100% Charcoal Infused Cotton Bath Mat Rug | China Blue | 19.3\" x 34\" | Super Soft & Highly Absorbent | Guest Bath Spa Designer Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916pID306PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After renovating houses for hundreds of families, hosts of HGTV’s “Property Brothers” Drew and Jonathan Scott know how to make a home work for everyone – and that includes high-quality home furnishings, textiles and décor that look great and fit your needs. Scott Living by Drew & Jonathan reflects their commitment to help you create the perfect space for the people you love. With the Scott Brothers’ latest collection featuring modern and nature-inspired patterns, you’re sure to make a statement. A DESIGNER LOOK TO LOVE in a 100% charcoal infused cotton bath rug. Made to last with anti-skid backing and absorbs quickly adding a luxurious staple to the bathroom. This rug is odor resistant lasting freshness. Plush and soft looped fibers, machine washable for easy care. Choose from a range of attractive color options for easy coordination with any existing bathroom decor. Includes 1 Bath Rug Measuring approx. 19.3” x 34”. MUST HAVE FEATURES, Our contemporary bath rugs are constructed for everyday performance and a home luxury feel. This rug is made with activated charcoal infused yarns allowing fibers to fight off odor to remain fresh for the life of the bath rug. Our bath rugs are designed with your safety in mind and feature a non-slip, anti-skid backing. Clean lines, quality materials and easy care create the perfect designer bathroom rug for you, family or guest. CAREFULLY DESIGNED, Scott Living home products are better for you, your family, and the planet. Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental safety standards and are tested for harmful substances. Our sustainable products are manufactured under environmentally friendly and socially responsible working conditions. Our cotton textiles feature sustainably sourced fibers that are environmentally friendly as cotton fibers are naturally biodegradable. EASY CARE, Machine wash separately, in warm water with gentle cycle. Do not bleach or use detergents without bleach granules. Tumble dry low. Do not dry clean. Do not iron. We stand by our product and offer a 30-DAY \"LOVE-IT\" GUARANTEE, \"We're not happy unless you're happy\". We recommend for an added polished look, pair or gift with the coordinating Scott Living Terrain Charcoal Cotton Blend Towel Set. Each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916pID306PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B09NKPGR39","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NKPGR39","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NKPGR39","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
