window.products.push({"id":466523,"name":"GoodOldSaying - Poem for Inspirations - Face to face I shall behold Him – Carrie E. Breck. 8x10 Biblical Verse set in Double Mat (Blue On Gold) - A Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512bg9MzAxL._AC_.jpg","description":"CAPTION - - [Face to face I shall behold Him, Far beyond the starry sky; Face to face in all His glory, I shall see him by and by! – Carrie E. Breck – Face to face with Christ] - - - - - - Give it as-is or use it as a substitute to ordinary blank greeting card. It is such a beautiful way to convey your message for the special moment and occasion. - - - We suggest using special Silver Metallic Colored-Ink pen to write your message, sign and date for added value as keepsake. Enhance the presentation of your message with a frame (NOT INCLUDED) that can be displayed for years to come. Unlike giving the conventional greeting card, your message will not risk being tossed or put away in file drawers. A unique and/or perfect medium for your message to the ones you love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512bg9MzAxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoodOldSaying","source_asin":"B01JJZPGQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JJZPGQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JJZPGQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":466524,"name":"AMERICAN MERCANTILE Cast Iron Owl Hook, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BgWg8Z7-L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Our Home Decor is hand made and hand painted to give great detail and depth to each item we sell. Most items are designed right here in the US and shipped globally with a reputation for the quality of the item and value that comes with it. We know you will be completely satisfied with the purchase of our Owl Hook.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BgWg8Z7-L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERICAN MERCANTILE","source_asin":"B00KC7GANM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KC7GANM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KC7GANM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":466525,"name":"AtmosFX Santa's Workshop Digital Decorations DVD for Christmas Holiday Projection Decorating","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SjFdHEaTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your holiday decorating with AtmosFX digital decorations! Transform any any environment or surface into a delightfully festive experience using a digital projector, TV, or monitor. Santa's Workshop includes the following digital decoration scenes, with display mode options to suit a variety of different uses. DECK THE HALLS: Santa's elves are hard at work, preparing for the holiday season by decorating the Christmas tree in their workshop with tinsel, lights and a crowning star. MARCH OF THE WOODEN SOLDIER: The elves are eager to show Santa their new 6-foot wooden toy soldier. But, when one of them accidentally overwinds the new plaything, it begins to run amok in the workshop. PACKING SANTA'S SLEIGH: On the biggest night of the year the lists get checked and rechecked as bags of toys are loaded into the sleigh. As Santa prepares to depart, everyone celebrates with a festive sendoff. THE GREAT GIFT WRAPPER: Santa's workshop is equipped with an ingenious gift-wrapping machine that wraps toys for the children of the world. But, when one inquisitive elf gets a little too close to the new machine, the holiday hijinks begin. TOY TINKERING: Santa's elves are hard at work during this busy time of year, creating toys for children around the world. When the toy-making process encounters some unexpected glitches, Santa steps-in to provide a necessary helping hand. AtmosFX DVDs are intended for private, home use. Commercial use of these decorations requires a special licensing agreement from AtmosFX.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SjFdHEaTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AtmosFX","source_asin":"B01M5JN1IJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M5JN1IJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M5JN1IJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
