window.products.push({"id":466609,"name":"Reusable Storage Bags - Pahajim 6 Pack Stand Up Reusable Freezer Bags(3 Reusable Gallon Bags + 3 Reusable Sandwich Bags) BPA FREE Reusable Ziplock Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xkiuZFUaL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"【FOOD GRADE MATERIALS & REUSABLE】Made of eco-friendly food grade material PEVA(BPA-FREE, biodegradable). These ziplock bags are washable and reusable which make it a perfect substitute for plastic bags.One PEVA bag is equivalent to 350+ disposable plastic bags. 【LEAK-PROOF & COLORFUL ZIPPER】These reusable sandwich bags adopt the updated zipper sealing technology which is more airtight, leak proof, waterproof, clean and hygienic, perfect for storing and preserving food. With the improved zipper and an anti-slip design, the reusable sandwich bag is easier to open or close, even for a child. 【FREEZER SAFE & EASY TO CLEAN】The reusable freezer bags have ultra-low temperature resistance, it can withstand low temperature below - 70 ℃, suitable for ice environment. It is a perfect choice for keeping freezing meat, chicken, fish, fruits and vegetables fresh. The storage bag is top notch in terms of softness and toughness, so it's very easy to clean. However, they are not suitable for dishwashers as dishwasher may cause zipper deformation. HAND WASH is recommended!!! 【WIDELY USE】3 reusable lunch bags: 10 x 7.2 x 2 inch; 3 reusable sandwich bags: 8 x 5.7 x 2 inch. This reusable bag for food is very light and easy to carry. Your children no longer need to carry heavy and space occupying containers with these lunch bags. For yourself, you can use these storage bags to pack picnic food, or you can use them to pack your toiletries and small items when you are on travel. Transparent design makes it easier to see what's inside. 【100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】If some of the reusable food bags in the set are lost or damaged, it should be caused during transportation. Don't worry!! Contact us first!! We will provide you with satisfactory service. Thanks for your kindly understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xkiuZFUaL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pahajim","source_asin":"B088R6J86V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088R6J86V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088R6J86V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
