window.products.push({"id":466619,"name":"Yarmoshi Cheese Slicer/Cheese Plane and Server for Hard and Semi-Hard Cheeses. Non-Stick Clear PS Blade. Ergonomic Penguin Handle with Non-Slip Rubber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pT1v-zGwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐧THE YARMOSHI CHEESE SLICER / PLANE is one of a kind. The blade and server are made of non-stick, clear PS which makes it a safer and lighter option than steel cutters and at the same time is equally as sharp and easy to use. A comfortable handle is a must and our handle is shaped like a penguin not just because it’s pretty but also because of its ergonomic shape and non-slip rubber coating for easy and safe grip which allows you to cut through hard cheeses in a breeze. 🐧DO I REALLY NEED A CHEESE SLICER? Well, that depends on whether you like your cheese sliced or hacked. If you like to see uniform slim or medium slices of cheese on your cheese platter then you have to have a handheld cheese slicer. It cuts neatly avoiding problems of sticking or crumbling that you get with knives. 🐧ONE STEP TO SERVING CHEESE AESTHETICALLY! With the Yarmoshi cheese slicer and server, you slice your cheese and it stays on the serving tray. From here you serve it directly to your guest’s plate. The perfect slice every time. It works best for hard cheeses like Cheddar or Gouda or semi-hard cheeses like Edam or Gruyere. It’s also brilliant for shaving Parmesan. 🐧KEEP IT CLOSE! You’ll be surprised how often you’ll want to use this special gadget. At just 8” long and 3” wide, it’s easy to store in your gadget drawer or to hang from the special hole in the handle and if you collect the rest of this series of tools, you can have your own family of penguins living in your kitchen. 🐧WANT TO MAKE THE CHEF IN YOUR LIFE HAPPY? This is the way to do it. The purpose of a practical gift is to make life easier and this does. PLACE IN YOUR CART and start slicing and shaving with ease. This item carries a 30-day 100% full refund policy so this is a no-risk purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pT1v-zGwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YARMOSHI","source_asin":"B07BKTQN3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BKTQN3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BKTQN3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
