window.products.push({"id":466670,"name":"HONJO MULLER Utility Knife - 5\" Mini Utility Knife for Chopping and Slicing | Small Utility Knife Made From German Outokumpu Stainless Steel | Extra S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YQympGAZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5\" ALL PURPOSE UTILITY KNIFE KITCHEN SIZE - The HONJO-MÜLLER 5\" Utility Knife is perfectly sized between a professional chefs knife and paring knife for all-round versatility. The ideal in-between knife kitchen utility size for your everyday cooking needs. Made in China EXTRA SHARP UTILITY KNIFE FOR CLEAN, PRECISE CUTTING - The HONJO MULLER chef utility knife is large enough to tackle big tasks yet small enough for precise, detailed cuts. The utility knife long blade glides through meat, veggies, and fruits quickly and effortlessly. CHEFS UTILITY KNIFE MADE WITH PREMIUM GERMAN STEEL - The tough, full tang HONJO-MÜLLER 5\" cutting utility knife is crafted from German Outokumpu high performance stainless steel. The razor-sharp utility knife fixed blade is extremely durable and holds a sharp edge much longer. UTILITY COOKING KNIFE FOR CUTTING FRUITS, VEGGIES, AND MEAT - The stainless steel utility knife can be used to cut, chop and dice a range of soft and hard foods. Use it as a veg and fruit knife, tomato slicer knife, peeling knife, salami knife, and more. ULTRA-SHARP 5 INCH CHEF KNIFE FOR PRECISE CUTS - The HONJO-MÜLLER 5\" medium size chef knife utility design is a perfectly balanced, ultra-sharp utility cutter and slicer that gives you total control and enhanced agility over all your chopping and cutting. SLEEK, CONTEMPORARY STANDARD UTILITY KNIFE - Sleek, modern design with a sharp blade knife utility cutting face looks and performs to peak cooking standards. Simply stunning precision utility knife with sharp blade that's built to impress. WOOD HANDLE UTILITY KNIFE FOR COMFORTABLE AND EASY USE - The utility knives for kitchen have a Pakkawood handle that's built around a full tang construction to give you a secure, ultra-comfortable grip. The camping utility knife feels just right as you cut and slice. PREMIUM UTILITY KNIFE MAKES THE PERFECT GIFT - HONJO MULLER utility blade knife is the perfect gift for those on a budget. High-quality, finely honed construction with comfortable grip makes this the best utility knife gift for every home cook or chef! LIGHTWEIGHT UTILITY KNIFE FOR EASE OF USE - The utility knife small and light design grants ease of use and maximum maneuverability when slicing and cutting. It's the perfect substitute for larger professional chef knives that may be too big for the task at hand. CLASSIC UTILITY KNIFE WITH UNMATCHED AFFORDABILITY - HONJO MÜLLER prides itself on providing the best utility knives that go unmatched in terms of affordability and build. We only use the best materials available to construct a professional utility knife that's finely honed for long-lasting performance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YQympGAZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HONJO-MÜLLER","source_asin":"B09QFNJFK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QFNJFK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QFNJFK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
