window.products.push({"id":466807,"name":"MontVoo-Bath Mats for Bathroom Non Slip with Rubber Backing, Absorbent Terrycloth Bath-Rugs, Machine Washable Bathroom-Mat, Thin Bathroom Rugs Fit Und","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s9Kt2i11L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTRA ABSORBENT: Our bathroom rugs are made of 100% high-end polyester with a terrycloth-like surface, it soaks up an impressive amount of water. Keep water from slipping, bunching, or sliding out from under your feet! The best part is that the bath rug dries remarkably fast. Different from standard bath rugs, it does not always become so soggy. This is great for the next person in the shower. FIT UNDER THE DOOR: According to the design of most family showers, plus it’s thin enough to fit under the door. Moreover, this bath mat will not hinder the passage of sweeping robots and wheelchairs. RUBBER BACKING: A reliable bathroom rug must prevent slipping with a protective rubber backing. These bath mats for bathroom have a heavy-duty rubber backing, and good gripping on the back. Moreover, rubber backing is more durable and won’t be smelly after long-term use. MACHINE WASHABLE: Montvoo bathroom rugs are machine washable on a cold, gentle cycle and safe for tumble drying on low. Don't worry about shedding and fading after multiple machine washes. AESTHETIC BATHROOM RUGS: How perfectly do these fit in the bathroom! Inspired by the cross-section of a diamond, we designed this simple, understated rhombus pattern to fit most home shower designs. Rolling package without stubborn creases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s9Kt2i11L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MontVoo","source_asin":"B0BW84MBXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW84MBXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW84MBXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":466808,"name":"Land of the Wee, Premium Big Kids Hooded Towel for Boys & Girls, 100% Extra Soft Bamboo, Perfect for Ages 7 and up to 100 pounds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qxVwrVnSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTRA LARGE HOODED TOWEL - Our oversized big kids hooded towels are one of the largest you can find and one of the only that can easily fit kids up to age 12. Covers head and body all at once, so you don’t have to deal with dripping hair, or cold heads. This oversized hooded bath towel measures 36 x 60 inches. Its durable and timeless design is one that your child will continue to love from year to year. Wet dry bag included for easy storage and is also an eco-friendly packaging alternative. WARM COZY KIDS - Sourcing only the highest quality natural and organically grown bamboo ensures our big kids hooded towel is unbeatably soft and silky; our premium bamboo hooded towel is highly absorbent and extra thick to keep kids warm and dry; say goodbye to the shivers HYPOALLERGENIC & IDEAL FOR SENSITIVE SKIN – Rest assured that your child will be extra warm and comfortable with the anti-static, cling-free benefits of bamboo towels. Your child’s comfort is our top priority and that’s why we chose a durable and thick hooded towel that's also extra-gentle on the skin. Ideal for kids with eczema or other sensitive skin issues. EARTH FRIENDLY - Made out of 100% Eco-harvest Bamboo material our big kids bath towels are earth conscious and a premium quality hooded bath towel; also included is a wet dry bag perfect for towel storage after a day at the beach or swimming lessons at the pool QUALITY GUARANTEED: We know our organically grown bamboo kids towels are the best you can buy and we want you to know it too; from our family to yours, we offer a 100% manufacturer guarantee; we proudly stand behind our products and know what it's like to want the best for your family","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qxVwrVnSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Land of the Wee","source_asin":"B08NTVNHB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NTVNHB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NTVNHB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
