window.products.push({"id":466848,"name":"COSTWAY 11,500 BTU Portable Air Conditioner, with Dual Hose, Remote Control, Powerful AC Unit Rooms up to 400 Sq.Ft. with Dehumidifier, Fan, Sleep Mod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fYB6HTYPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Enjoy fresh and cool wind in summer with this portable air conditioner. Featuring 3 operating modes (cool, dry and fan) and 3 fan speeds, this portable air conditioner is able to meet your various needs in different seasons. The 11,500 BTU powerful cooling capacity and dual hose design enable rapid cooling to large spaces up to 400 sq.ft. Besides, the sleep mode and 24H timer ensure high quality sleeping. There are 2 water drainage methods: manual and continuous. With over-flow protection, you can be reassured keeping this AC unit operating the whole night. The installation to the window is easy with instruction and window installation kit. And you can move this portable air conditioner easily with carry handles and universal wheels. Features: 11,500 BTU cooling capacity offers high efficient performance Cools down rooms up to 400 sq.ft, suitable for home, office, etc. The louvers can be adjusted automatically and manually Features 3 operating modes (cool, dry and fan) and 3 fan speeds Can be controlled through the control panel and remote control Equipped with sleep mode and 24H timer Applicable for manual and continuous drainage Built with over-flow protection for increased safety Comes with instruction and window installation kit Easy to move with carry handles and universal wheels The air filter is removable and washable Specifications: Color: White  Material: ABS Overall Dimension: 16\" x 15\" x 29\"(L x W x H) Cooling Capacity: 11500 BTU(ASHRAE)/8000 BTU (SACC) Recommended Cooling Area: 400 sq.ft Air Flow: 380 m³/h Wind Speed: High/Medium/Low Dehumidifying Capacity: 76 Pints/Day Adjustable Temperature Range: 62℉~86℉ Timing Range: 0-24 Hours Noise Level: ≤55dB Voltage: 115V 60Hz Big Exhaust Hose Length: 5.2 ft Big Exhaust Hose Diameter: 6\" Small Exhaust Hose Length: 5 ft Small Exhaust Hose Diameter: 5\" Drainage Hose Length: 9.8 ft Power Cord Length: 6 ft Max Effective Distance of the Remote Control: 16.4 ft Applicable Window Size Range: 25\"-50\" Net Weight: 66 lbs Package includes： 1 x Portable Air Conditioner 1 x Remote Control 1 x Window Venting Kit 1 x Drain Hose 1 x User Guide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fYB6HTYPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B0BVMNNBRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVMNNBRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVMNNBRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":466849,"name":"Bialetti Mia, 6 Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XYXFTEJXL._AC_.jpg","description":"With its polished finish and contemporary design, this kettle-shaped stovetop espresso maker brews up to 6 cups of rich, authentic Italian espresso in just four to five minutes. The unit's construction features long-lasting 18/10 stainless steel (all parts except for the blue knob on the lid), and operating the unit is a snap. Just fill the lower chamber with water and the top integral filter with fine-ground coffee. Then place the pot on the stove and heat until the water boils. Through the dual-chamber design and pressurizing process, espresso quickly rises into the upper chamber of the pot, ready to be served. Other highlights include a screw-off bottom, a blue knob made of heat-resistant plastic, a flip-up lid, and a unique pour spout and generous handle that make for no-hassle serving. When finished using the unit, wash it by hand with warm soapy water and rinse clean. Designed by Guido Bergna and made in Italy, the stovetop espresso maker measures 4-1/2 inches wide by 8-1/2 inches tall and carries a limited lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XYXFTEJXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bialetti","source_asin":"B0001DJT9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001DJT9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001DJT9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
