window.products.push({"id":466858,"name":"Holy Nativity Christmas Decorations Banner Manger Scene Religious Christmas Yard Sign Banner for Merry Christmas Xmas Outdoor Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M1TF0jNLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIZE OF THE NATIVITY BANNER? 9.8ft * 1.96ft / 300cm * 60cm WHERE CAN IT BE USED? You can hanging it in the living room, or on the bushes, yard, big fence, fireplace，also can be the photo prop to take pictures ABOUT CREASE? Because Jesus banners are folded for transportation, creases will inevitably occur. You can use the following methods to eliminate creases: Method 1: Use a low temperature iron to lightly iron the back of the banner. It must be low temperature, otherwise the banner will easily curl due to the temperature. This is the fastest method. Method 2: Use a round stick to roll up the banner and place it for a few days, and the creases will naturally be eliminated. But in general, darker banners are less creases visible, so they can be used directly . ABOUT FADING? Because the banner uses printing technology instead of dip dyeing, it is easy to fade due to changes in temperature, but according to feedback, it can generally be stored outdoors for about 2 weeks , and indoors can be stored for a longer time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M1TF0jNLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mokeja party","source_asin":"B08Q7C7RXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q7C7RXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q7C7RXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":466859,"name":"Modus Furniture Madeleine Linen Wingback Headboard, King, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":401.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91owMgR7BaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Madeleine King Wingback premium headboard arrives fully assembled and extends all the way to the floor; because of its size this product ships via freight carrier. Designed to fit standard metal frames; also compatible with most non-standard metal frames using a Modi-plate or adaptor plate (sold separately). Mounting hardware included. Headboard legs are fitted with countersunk adjustable levelers for precise alignment. Threaded inserts are positioned at 5-5/8-inch, 6-1/4-inch, 8-1/8-inch and 8-3/4-inch above floor level; horizontal hole centers are 75-Inch. Headboard can be used with or without 4-inch wooden feet which can be attached in 5 minutes (tool included). Subtle shelter bed design accented with button tufting adds depth to any bedroom. Linen-like upholstery material is a soft, tightly woven, yarn-dyed fabric made from 100-percent polyester which is more stain resistant than cotton and linen; knitted backing gives a soft hand and increased durability; neutral tan color is achieved by weaving gray and beige threads. Also available as a complete bed with matching side rails, footboard and platform bed mattress support. Covered by a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. Product Dimensions: 6-Inch by 87-Inch by 54-Inch. Weighs 74-pounds. Indulgent tufting and cushioning surround you in luxury with the Geneva upholstered bed collection from Modus. Each model is wrapped from head to toe in a textural linen fabric for a tailored finish. With styles ranging from sleek and modern to lavishly hand tufted, the Geneva collection features elegant details like hand-hammered nails, high arching curves and piped edges that highlight each angle and shape. Large headboards let you pile pillows high or present a clean, neutral expanse. Tapered block feet are hand-finished in an Espresso tone, contrasting with the upholstery and broadening the range of compatible colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91owMgR7BaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B0B1RN691Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1RN691Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1RN691Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
