window.products.push({"id":466949,"name":"Reusable Grocery Shopping Tote Bags Set of 3 Eco-Friendly Lightweight Heavy Duty with Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hUaYm5v6L._AC_UL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description: Package: Largest Bag:14 x 18 x 4 inches. (36x45x10cm) x1 Medium Bag:13 x 15 x 4 inches.(32x38x10cm) x1 Small Bag:10 x 13 x 4 inches.(26x33x10cm) x1 Maintenance: The correct method of cleaning is to soak the bag with detergent for a few minutes until the stain gone. Then hang it in a ventilated place until it naturally dry，which will extend the durability of the bags. Eco-friendly life: According to the research more than 8 million tons of plastic are dumped in our cceans every year,many of thoese plastic are grocery plastic bags. Are you still using the plastic bags to ruin our ocean and world? It's time to stop using it! We have a replacement bag which is long lasting,more durable and reusable to replace the one-time-use paper and plastic bags.SO,say goodbye to plastic bags!Choose a stylish,study, and reusable bag from chuanhai now. Multipurpose: You shouldn’t limit the use of these practical eco tote bags to grocery shopping. Their design allows you to use this 3 different size tote bags for many other occassions.For example, you can use the shopping totes bags to carry clothes, books, laundry, hobby crafting supplies, gardening tools, ect. Great for store delicate gift or childrens' toys as well. Note: Due to long time folding, there may be some creases on the bag. We recommended you to use iron to make it flat.If you don't want to do this, you can open the package and place the bags in some flat places, then put a few heavy products on the bag for a few days. The crease will gradually disappear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hUaYm5v6L._AC_UL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"chuanhai","source_asin":"B07HWSC9FJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-466949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HWSC9FJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HWSC9FJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
